//// set: fc-c2 — 函数体归约：字面量范围展开、多迭代变量嵌套、嵌套推导式、外层 for 变量作范围、数组字面量范围
//// model: C20
function f
input Real x[2];
output Real y;
algorithm
y := sum(x[i] for i in 1:2);
end f;
model C20
Real z = f({time, 2});
end C20;
//// model: C21
function f
input Real a;
output Real o[3];
algorithm
o := {k * a for k in 1:3};
end f;
model C21
Real z[3] = f(time);
end C21;
//// model: C22
function f
input Integer m;
input Real a;
output Real y;
algorithm
y := sum(i * j * a for i in 1:m, j in 1:2);
end f;
model C22
Real z = f(2, time);
end C22;
//// model: C23
function f
input Integer m;
input Real a;
output Real o[m, 2];
algorithm
o := {{i * j * a for j in 1:2} for i in 1:m};
end f;
model C23
Real z[2, 2] = f(2, time);
end C23;
//// model: C24
function f
input Real x[:];
output Real y;
algorithm
y := min(x[i] for i in 1:size(x, 1));
end f;
model C24
Real z = f({time, 2});
end C24;
//// model: C25
function f
input Real x[:];
output Real y;
protected
Integer n = size(x, 1);
algorithm
y := sum(x[i] * x[n - i + 1] for i in 1:n);
end f;
model C25
Real z = f({time, 2});
end C25;
//// model: C26
function f
input Real x[:];
output Real y;
algorithm
y := 0;
for k in 1:size(x, 1) loop
y := y + sum(x[i] for i in 1:k);
end for;
end f;
model C26
Real z = f({time, 2});
end C26;
//// model: C27
function f
input Real a;
output Real o[2];
algorithm
o := array(a * i for i in {1, 3});
end f;
model C27
Real z[2] = f(time);
end C27;
//// model: C28
function f
input Integer m;
output Integer y;
algorithm
y := sum(i for i in 1:m);
end f;
model C28
Integer k = f(integer(time));
end C28;
//// model: C29
function f
input Real x[:];
output Real y[size(x, 1)];
algorithm
y := {sum(x[j] for j in 1:i) for i in 1:size(x, 1)};
end f;
model C29
Real z[2] = f({time, 2});
end C29;
